WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:19.355
Toad leaned out of the train.

2
00:00:19.356 --> 00:00:21.748
He looked down the tracks.

3
00:00:21.749 --> 00:00:25.126
A train was speeding after them.

4
00:00:25.127 --> 00:00:30.210
"Stop! Stop!" yelled the riders on the train.

5
00:00:30.211 --> 00:00:34.078
"They look like policemen!" said the engineer.

6
00:00:34.079 --> 00:00:38.102
The police waved their clubs angrily.

7
00:00:38.103 --> 00:00:40.537
Toad fell on his knees.

8
00:00:40.538 --> 00:00:45.147
"Save me!" he cried. "Save me!"

9
00:00:45.148 --> 00:00:48.142
"What?" asked the engineer.

10
00:00:48.143 --> 00:00:51.565
"I am not a washwoman!" cried Toad.

11
00:00:51.566 --> 00:00:53.746
"I do not have children!

12
00:00:53.747 --> 00:00:56.000
I am Mr. Toad!"

13
00:00:56.001 --> 00:00:59.153
The engineer was angry.

14
00:00:59.154 --> 00:01:02.071
"Why are they chasing you?" he asked.

15
00:01:02.072 --> 00:01:05.430
Embarrassed, Toad looked at him.

16
00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:09.633
"I escaped from jail," said Toad.

17
00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:12.948
"Why were you in prison?" said the engineer.

18
00:01:12.949 --> 00:01:15.989
"It wasn't serious," said Toad.

19
00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:18.485
"I just borrowed a car.

20
00:01:18.486 --> 00:01:21.735
But everyone got so upset about it."

21
00:01:21.736 --> 00:01:26.298
"I should let them arrest you," said the engineer.

22
00:01:26.299 --> 00:01:28.669
"But I don't like policemen.

23
00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:32.012
And I hate to see someone cry."

24
00:01:32.013 --> 00:01:36.206
The engineer added coal to the fire.

25
00:01:36.207 --> 00:01:41.141
"That will speed us up!" he said.

26
00:01:41.142 --> 00:01:44.957
But the other engine sped up too.

27
00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:48.548
"What am I going to do?" cried Toad.

28
00:01:48.549 --> 00:01:51.951
"You will have to jump," said the engineer.

29
00:01:51.952 --> 00:01:55.551
"What?" asked Toad, afraid.

30
00:01:55.552 --> 00:02:01.341
The engineer slowed the train.

31
00:02:01.342 --> 00:02:04.344
"Here's your chance," he shouted.

32
00:02:04.345 --> 00:02:05.614
"Jump!"

33
00:02:05.615 --> 00:02:13.117
Toad closed his eyes and jumped.
